## 🔄 Quick Review

### TOEIC

1. If I _____ more time, I would travel.
→ had

2. If I had studied harder, I _____ the exam.
→ would have passed

3. If I _____ you, I would accept the offer.
→ were

4. If we had known earlier, we _____ differently.
→ would have acted

